Objectives:
The objectives for the Paduca Grassland Restoration Project are to:
1. reduce honey mesquite, to account for less than 10 percent of the annual
production of the Sandy and Deep Sand ecological sites;
2. reduce honey mesquite, creosote bush, American tarbush, catclaw mimosa, and
whitethorn acacia to account for less than 5 percent of the annual production of
the Shallow ecological sites;
